  "printed_text": [
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:1746a92f0f26eedf98131c83c7ec1fc633bda3842d4efea8ee16ffe26eebb2b2",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 0,
      "confidence": 0.885431,
      "text": "(25)(本题共10分)"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:77e55f69f40d580c929136fc782c5813725715874609b309feb3e3de95d80663",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "confidence": 0.973713,
      "text": "抛物线y=ax2+bx+c(a,b,c为常数,a>0)与y轴相交于点C,且2a+b=0,"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:61f6e6f2a565310f143390178414661920f3bff8813f38f08274129e05aa7e2a",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "confidence": 0.999891,
      "text": "对称轴与x轴相交于点D"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:8f276309f035f545b211d23f58408d5605bce366697931cd2e0c6ce2d89fc09a",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "confidence": 0.952647,
      "text": "(II)若点M(m,1)和点N均在抛物线上,其中m>2,且点N在第四象限,"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:92e10335a011db74c13bd56e45e826fee89fd17ab039afde357fa4aeb0e3d373",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "confidence": 0.986476,
      "text": "∠MDN=90°,DM—DN.点E和点G分别是线段DM和线段MN上的动点,点F为线"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:253296dbc6c31346e7688370ab6ca9140ddc298cd8e60aaa329298d91028dbe8",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "confidence": 0.992517,
      "text": "段DN的中点,且DE=√2NG."
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:957ff0bd23513710fb00e8ae97900ec2c13dbd4f382f1b1bef221cb546584243",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "confidence": 0.999709,
      "text": "2当EG+FG取得最小值为"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:bc104d209866aae3bedcf3c36956611ffa6975ef9aa5fb5652d9bbc5d2398aa2",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "confidence": 0.994783,
      "text": "5√10"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:fb0d3ee6104d05904c83961b65d0f43bc82184cdc8af7c27dce234d291982a36",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "confidence": 0.990308,
      "text": "时,直接写出此时抛物线的解析式和点G的坐标."
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:7aab49f95d619f8ae7153d300d620ab60ab5d5cba9617d54ae9f0f5f2a4f6219",
      "page_id": "page_1",
